     3780       if NOT xShowSaleNds   and i = 9   Then  next.
     3781       if NOT xShowSaleSlt   and i = 10  Then  next.
     3782       if NOT xShowmediator  and i = 4   Then  next.
     3783       if not x-tog-wt       and i = 11  then  next.
     3784       if not x-tog-ms       and i = 12  then  next.
     3785       if not xDens          and i = 13  then  next.
     3786       assign
     3787         LL = LL + 1
     3788         l-nk = mp-1
     3789       .
     3790     if x-vat or i <> 2  then do:
     3791     if use-column[6]  then do: l-nk = l-nk + 1 .    run ex-display in this-procedure  (mp-1 + ll + (kk * (l-nk - mp))  , b2-ostatok-start                          [i] ,  i). end.
     3792     if use-column[7]  then do: l-nk = l-nk + 1 .    run ex-display in this-procedure  (mp-1 + ll + (kk * (l-nk - mp))  , b2-oborot-ie          [i] ,  i). end.
     3793     if use-column[8]  then do: l-nk = l-nk + 1 .    run ex-display in this-procedure  (mp-1 + ll + (kk * (l-nk - mp))  , b2-oborot-iv          [i] ,  i). end.
     3794     if use-column[9]  then do: l-nk = l-nk + 1 .    run ex-display in this-procedure  (mp-1 + ll + (kk * (l-nk - mp))  , b2-oborot-im           [i] ,  i). end.
     3795     if use-column[10] then do: l-nk = l-nk + 1 .    run ex-display in this-procedure  (mp-1 + ll + (kk * (l-nk - mp))  , b2-oborot-ee          [i] ,  i). end.
